---
<Base
  title="Stripchat's Plasma Streaming App: Do You Still Need OBS?"
  description="Stripchat's Plasma Streaming app lets models broadcast straight from a phone — no capture card, no OBS setup. What it actually does, when mobile streaming makes sense, and how studios should think about a roster that streams from phones."
