        <div class="art-cta__orb"></div>
        <div class="art-cta__inner">
          <span class="art-cta__badge">Models &amp; Studios</span>
          <h2>Whatever You're Streaming On, Traffic Still Has to Show Up</h2>
          <p>A phone or a full rig both need viewers finding the room in the first place. If you want help turning consistent sessions — mobile or not — into a real, growing audience, we work with independent models and studios on exactly that.</p>
          <div class="art-cta__actions">
            <a href="/model-promotion" class="art-cta__btn art-cta__btn--primary">Model promotion services →</a>
            <a href="/studio-traffic" class="art-cta__btn art-cta__btn--ghost">Studio traffic services →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

